      "content": "i hear ya, but i dont want to be constantly calling my doctor just for a grocery list lol. i feel like since i'm just eating more of a \"healthy\" thing, it should be fine right? if i just keep my portions somewhat consistent but just increase the overall amount of greens in my diet, can i just go ahead and do that?",
